WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.326
Let's line up forty-two plus thirty-five. Put tens under tens, and ones under ones.

2
00:00:07.633 --> 00:00:10.501
Forty-two has four tens and two ones.

3
00:00:11.001 --> 00:00:15.413
Thirty-five goes underneath. Put three below four, and five below two.

4
00:00:17.633 --> 00:00:19.131
Start with the ones.

5
00:00:19.631 --> 00:00:21.895
Two plus five equals seven.

6
00:00:22.395 --> 00:00:25.657
Write seven in the ones column. No regrouping is needed.

7
00:00:26.967 --> 00:00:28.395
Now add the tens.

8
00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:32.680
Four tens plus three tens equals seven tens.

9
00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:34.979
Write seven in the tens column.

10
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:43.846
Seven tens and seven ones make seventy-seven. Forty-two plus thirty-five equals seventy-seven.

11
00:00:45.175 --> 00:00:52.385
Keep each digit in its place. For forty-two plus five, the five belongs under the two, not under the four.

12
00:00:54.175 --> 00:01:01.129
Your turn! Line up twenty-three plus fourteen. Add the ones first, then the tens. Pause and try it.

13
00:01:05.133 --> 00:01:07.212
Three plus four is seven ones.

14
00:01:07.712 --> 00:01:10.916
Two tens plus one ten is three tens.

15
00:01:11.416 --> 00:01:13.181
The answer is thirty-seven.
